-end security environments."}]}]}],["$","$L2f",null,{"items":[{"id":"overview","label":"Overview"},{"id":"specs","label":"Technical Specifications"},{"id":"inquiry","label":"Contact us"}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"features","className":"detail-section alt","style":{"padding":"100px 0","backgroundColor":"#f8fafc"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","$L30",null,{"className":"rich-content auto-grid","html":"<h4>Features</h4><ul><li>29-inch large display for clear, real-time zone-mapping visualization of detected devices.</li><li>Daily Item Filtering: Excludes belt buckles, glasses, pens, pencil cases and other everyday items during phone detection.</li><li>Zone Display: 6 independent detection zones with accurate per-zone suspicious item display.</li><li>People Counting: Automatic real-time display of passage count and alarm count on the main interface.</li><li>Four-Side LED Positioning: LED indicators on all four sides display the prohibited item location with 360° visibility.</li><li>Audio-Visual Alarm: Voice alarm and LED strip flash alarm functions.</li></ul>"}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"specs","className":"detail-section","style":{"padding":"80px 0","backgroundColor":"#fff"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","style":{"textAlign":"center","marginBottom":"50px","fontSize":"3.6rem","fontWeight":700},"children":"Technical Specifications"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"border":"1px solid #eee","overflowX":"auto"},"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"spec-table","style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","minWidth":"600px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"style":{"background":"#f4f7fa","color":"#333","borderBottom":"2px solid #315ba4"},"children":[["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","textAlign":"left","fontSize":"1.6rem","fontWeight":"bold"},"children":"Parameter"}],["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 